# Party chat test (docs/re-party-chat.md) in Thieves' Woods; run with --save on a copy of Jeff's save.
# The current hint (flag 0x14, "he ran off toward Perit Village") bounces, plays, stops. Then flag 0x193
# is poked on (been to Perit): the Perit-only line is out here, the "head back to Perit" line plays.
include boot_from_save
wait 60
peek u16 0x020B6BE4 map
peek u16 0x020B8056 figures_flags
shot woods_icon_0
wait 4
shot woods_icon_4
wait 4
shot woods_icon_8
press Y 3
wait 150
shot woods_y
press A 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 60
peek u16 0x020B8056 figures_flags_after
shot woods_after_0
wait 4
shot woods_after_4
dump 0x02204620 0x5C flags_after_woods
poke u32 0x02204650 0x000E0000
wait 10
peek u16 0x020B8056 figures_flags_perit_stage
shot woods_p_icon_0
wait 4
shot woods_p_icon_4
press Y 3
wait 150
shot woods_p_y
press A 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 60
peek u16 0x020B8056 figures_flags_perit_after
shot woods_p_after
